<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Soccer-Ireland beat Liechtenstein  5-0 in qualifie.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Ireland beat Liechtenstein  5-0 in qualifie.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland beat Liechtenstien 5-0 (halftime 3-0) in their World Cup soccer European group eight qualifying match at Lansdowne Road on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: David Connolly 28, 35 and 41, Tony Cascarino 60 and 78.</p>
<p>Attendance: 33,000</p>
</text>
